WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.205 --> 00:00:06.593
This is the new AudioSilo player. Home opens on the book I’m in the middle of.

2
00:00:06.593 --> 00:00:10.920
Time left at my speed, and the day I’ll finish at my pace.

3
00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:20.057
Next in the series, including books I don’t have yet.

4
00:00:20.057 --> 00:00:24.604
Smart shelves keep themselves up to date.

5
00:00:24.604 --> 00:00:30.856
The library leads with covers.

6
00:00:30.856 --> 00:00:34.929
Series are shelves, in reading order.

7
00:00:34.929 --> 00:00:40.410
Search is everywhere. Press ⌘K and type.

8
00:00:40.410 --> 00:00:46.378
Books I don’t own yet stand on the shelf as ghost spines, with their real titles.

9
00:00:50.261 --> 00:00:54.831
This book page carries community data: a description, characters and recaps.

10
00:00:54.831 --> 00:01:00.903
My bookmarks and notes sit on the whole-book timeline.

11
00:01:00.903 --> 00:01:09.568
Who’s who lists only the people I’ve already met.

12
00:01:09.568 --> 00:01:21.280
Everyone later in the book stays hidden until I get there.

13
00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:32.468
Recaps stop at my chapter. The whole-book summary waits behind a spoiler tap.

14
00:01:32.468 --> 00:01:41.468
Press play and the player docks at the bottom of every page.

15
00:01:41.468 --> 00:01:52.835
Jump anywhere. After a big jump there’s a way back for ten seconds.

16
00:01:52.835 --> 00:01:58.913
The full player. The bars are this chapter, the strip below is the whole book.

17
00:01:58.913 --> 00:02:03.544
Speed shows what it does to the time left.

18
00:02:03.544 --> 00:02:08.193
Sleep at the end of a chapter, or after a few.

19
00:02:08.193 --> 00:02:11.191
Who’s who follows along as I listen.

20
00:02:11.191 --> 00:02:18.296
Reach a new chapter and the people I’ve just met appear. Nothing past my place.

21
00:02:18.296 --> 00:02:23.736
My bookmarks, each with a label and a note.

22
00:02:23.736 --> 00:02:32.945
Up next is my queue, with the rest of the series suggested underneath.

23
00:02:32.945 --> 00:02:40.148
My listening: the week, the streak, and the days I listened.

24
00:02:40.148 --> 00:02:51.239
When I listen, who I listen to, and the year’s finished books as a stack.

25
00:02:51.239 --> 00:03:03.280
Year in listening tells it as a story, a card at a time.

26
00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:11.163
The Journal keeps every day I listened, and all my bookmarks and notes.

27
00:03:11.163 --> 00:03:18.035
The same app runs on the web, iPhone and iPad.
